1
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:23,850
The prosecutor's office has investigated

2
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:27,050
the employees of K Corporation for tax evasion.

3
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:30,120
They've also extended their investigation

4
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,830
of slush funds and off-shore tax evasion as well.

5
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:36,620
Are you planning to hand this over to Se Gwang?

6
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:39,260
The Ahn Do Hoon file that you wanted

7
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,980
is in the safe deposit box.

8
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:43,330
When he becomes a threat to us,

9
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:45,780
it might help you.

10
00:00:46,790 --> 00:00:48,360
This will hurt not only the K Corporation,

11
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:50,380
but you as well.

12
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,300
Listen to it when you have time.

13
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:56,150
It's the testimony of the truck driver. It should be interesting.

14
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:59,860
Why didn't you think about it when you dumped my father?

15
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:04,270
You don't have enough evidence, what do you want?

16
00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:07,880
Should I destroy Jo Min Hyuk completely?

17
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:10,640
It won't end here.

18
00:01:10,940 --> 00:01:14,280
I'll bring you to court, no matter what it takes.

19
00:01:14,550 --> 00:01:18,120
In the place you worshiped so much,

20
00:01:18,830 --> 00:01:21,740
you'll have to confess to your crime.

21
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:26,180
I can't... I can't let it end here.

22
00:01:41,890 --> 00:01:46,800
What? Are you scared?

23
00:01:48,570 --> 00:01:52,460
Why is Mr. Ahn here?

24
00:01:55,210 --> 00:01:58,870
The painting bribe of Shina Gallery that Mr. Choi was engaged in.

25
00:01:59,460 --> 00:02:02,890
If I reveal those who were involved, it'll cause a big stir.

26
00:02:02,890 --> 00:02:06,400
But don't worry. I can stop it.

27
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:10,560
- What are you doing? - This company that your father has built

28
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:13,060
might collapse.

29
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:23,010
Listen to me. I'm the most qualified person to defend you.

30
00:02:29,090 --> 00:02:33,460
I'm the one who can protect Mr. Jo.

31
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:39,090
Ahn Do Hoon fomr the Legal Team of the K Corporation,

32
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:43,790
What are you going to do?

33
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:52,220
What are you doing here?

34
00:02:55,130 --> 00:02:59,720
Both you and I are in danger.

35
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:06,040
Choose between living together, or dying together.

36
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:10,410
- Shin Se Yeon! - You, the K Corporation,

37
00:03:10,410 --> 00:03:13,350
Se Yeon, and Se Yeon's father will be in trouble.

38
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:19,470
Ah! Let's not forget Yoo Jung. I know her more than anyone.

39
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:23,590
She'll blame herself for what happened.

40
00:03:23,590 --> 00:03:25,430
She'll be upset.

41
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:27,630
I told you to stay away from Yoo Jung.

42
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:34,660
You have to choose between your company and the woman that you love so much.

43
00:03:36,080 --> 00:03:39,800
You'll choose the K Corporation in the end.

44
00:03:43,670 --> 00:03:48,540
Can you still say that we're different?

45
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:56,650
I want to ask you something.

46
00:03:59,610 --> 00:04:01,220
What are you doing?

47
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:04,560
I'm sure you're well aware of what I'm doing.

48
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:11,370
What are you going to do now?

49
00:04:23,050 --> 00:04:29,290
- Yoo Jung, listen to me! - Are you okay?

50
00:04:29,290 --> 00:04:31,860
No matter what Mr. Ahn said.

51
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:34,380
- Do what you should do. - Sir.

52
00:04:36,090 --> 00:04:40,340
- You trust me, right? - Yes.

53
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:43,610
I'll not be defeated that easily.

54
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:47,390
Trust me and go.

55
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,380
I told you,

56
00:05:27,380 --> 00:05:29,730
we are different.

57
00:05:30,490 --> 00:05:33,220
I'm going to visit your father.

58
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:35,290
The news of our break up will be printed tomorrow.

59
00:05:35,290 --> 00:05:37,650
Are you really going to do this?

60
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:39,500
Is she that important to you?

61
00:05:39,500 --> 00:05:43,030
I'm breaking off this engagement.

62
00:05:43,030 --> 00:05:45,640
I'll be responsible for it.

63
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:50,350
I'll do my best not to hurt you.

64
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:52,610
- I'm sorry it took so long. - Min Hyuk!

65
00:05:52,610 --> 00:05:54,920
Bring back the Se Yeon I once knew.

66
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:56,760
Being destructive and irrational like this

67
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:58,990
isn't you.

68
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:15,320
You used Yoo Jung, and now Se Yeon?

69
00:06:16,610 --> 00:06:21,110
Do not hurt the Shina Foundation.

70
00:06:24,370 --> 00:06:27,820
You're the one who let this happen.

71
00:06:27,860 --> 00:06:32,710
If anything happens to Se Yeon, it's your fault.

72
00:06:33,350 --> 00:06:38,020
And to the K Corporation. You'll regret it.

73
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:47,390
I won't. If I stop Yoo Jung

74
00:06:47,750 --> 00:06:50,370
to save myself, that I'll regret.

75
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:56,460
You're first the heir of the K Corporation

76
00:06:56,460 --> 00:06:58,750
then Yoo Jung's man.

77
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:03,400
Don't forget that the K Corporation is in danger.

78
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:07,420
I'm not going down alone.

79
00:07:07,420 --> 00:07:14,090
If I have to, I'll take you down with me.

80
00:07:44,210 --> 00:07:47,570
- Are you okay? - Yes.

81
00:07:49,250 --> 00:07:51,700
What about you?

82
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:06,140
As long as you're okay.

83
00:08:07,450 --> 00:08:12,100
I'll tell the press that I'm not going to marry Se Yeon tomorrow.

84
00:08:16,650 --> 00:08:20,540
I made my choice. You don't have to worry.

85
00:08:21,730 --> 00:08:27,660
You can just stay with me, okay?

86
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:48,520
It's a breaking news if it's true.

87
00:08:48,970 --> 00:08:51,860
- Are you going to be okay?? - If I worried about me,

88
00:08:51,860 --> 00:08:53,810
I wouldn't have done it.

89
00:09:03,260 --> 00:09:06,910
I'm not slandering the K Corporation

90
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:09,690
to do some illegal business for management right.

91
00:09:09,690 --> 00:09:12,010
President Jo

92
00:09:15,070 --> 00:09:17,220
and Jo Min Hyuk

93
00:09:17,220 --> 00:09:21,630
has been accumulating slush funds and bribing.

94
00:09:21,660 --> 00:09:25,370
As a prosecutor, Ahn Do Hoon investigated the K Corporation's illegal activities.

95
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:28,330
He joined the K Corporation after he resigned...

96
00:09:28,570 --> 00:09:32,710
Yes. President Jo doesn't know about this.

97
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:41,580
I stopped the news about the breakup.

98
00:09:41,580 --> 00:09:45,520
- Father! - Don't ever that kind of woman in front of me again.

99
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:47,680
She is not that kind of woman to me.

100
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:50,250
- She is... - Are you going to marry a girl,

101
00:09:50,250 --> 00:09:52,770
who was involved with that bastard?

102
00:09:59,980 --> 00:10:01,540
You idiot.

103
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:07,830
- He's here! He's here! - Mr. Jo! Mr. Jo!

104
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:10,480
Excuse me, could you tell us what happened?

105
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:13,350
The information regardign Shina Foundation were released,

106
00:10:13,350 --> 00:10:14,960
- Any comment? - Any comment?

107
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,330
Please tell us.

108
00:10:16,330 --> 00:10:19,080
Is what Mr. Ahn said true?

109
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:36,070
Mr. Ahn didn't come to work today.

110
00:10:36,330 --> 00:10:39,080
- What the hell are you doing? - Sorry.

111
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:42,510
Call a press conference and prepare our statement.

112
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:44,420
Yes, sir!

113
00:10:45,290 --> 00:10:48,440
Kwang Soo, let's visit Gwang Min.

114
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:51,300
I have to do something about this.

115
00:11:03,700 --> 00:11:07,640
- What are you doing? - That's what I want to ask you.

116
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:13,140
I told you. I wouldn't go to jail alone.

117
00:11:13,690 --> 00:11:16,470
I'll go to jail with Jo Min Hyuk, who you want to protect so badly.

118
00:11:16,470 --> 00:11:20,390
Stop it. Stop it right now.

119
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:22,420
Try if you can.

120
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:24,790
It won't be easy.

121
00:11:25,810 --> 00:11:28,540
I've only revealed the truth.

122
00:11:28,540 --> 00:11:33,110
The truth? I can reveal the truth as well.

123
00:11:34,150 --> 00:11:36,270
About who you really are.

124
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:38,420
Get out!

125
00:11:39,620 --> 00:11:43,330
Attend the cross-examination tomorrow.

126
00:11:43,770 --> 00:11:45,460
Get out!

127
00:12:50,990 --> 00:12:52,870
Wow! Kang Yoo Jung.

128
00:12:53,860 --> 00:12:57,630
I'm glad my hard work of following you around paid off.

129
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:01,690
See!

130
00:13:01,730 --> 00:13:03,930
I came because I knew you'd be worried.

131
00:13:03,930 --> 00:13:06,420
But, it's because of me.

132
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:15,100
Don't say that.

133
00:13:16,700 --> 00:13:21,330
Just tell me that ‘everything will be okay.'

134
00:13:23,020 --> 00:13:26,540
‘Everything will be okay.' Say it!

135
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:34,750
Everything will be okay.

136
00:13:38,400 --> 00:13:46,170
Good. Since you said so, I'm not worried anymore.

137
00:14:38,230 --> 00:14:40,840
What happened?

138
00:14:44,570 --> 00:14:47,140
My father was here.

139
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:58,330
He's very concerned about his reputation. Don't mention this to anyone, please.

140
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:04,360
I didn't expose the Sina Foundation.

141
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:07,260
The things that they're investigating...

142
00:15:07,630 --> 00:15:09,540
That's all right.

143
00:15:09,870 --> 00:15:12,730
Look at you, how can you be all right?

144
00:15:22,350 --> 00:15:24,190
I can stop it now if you want.

145
00:15:24,490 --> 00:15:25,730
What if I stop now?

146
00:15:25,980 --> 00:15:30,600
Can you leave with me?

147
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:44,890
You said you'd love to.

148
00:15:49,990 --> 00:15:52,190
Let's go.

149
00:15:53,920 --> 00:16:00,580
You can do what you want and forget this whole thing.

150
00:16:01,370 --> 00:16:13,410
Thank you. Thanks to you, I'm really getting married to Min Hyuk.

151
00:16:34,820 --> 00:16:38,650
I prevented your father from leaving the hospital.

152
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:43,110
Tomorrow, tell your father that you'll marry Se Yeon as planned.

153
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,040
Get out!

154
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:46,520
You won't be happy if you oppose your father.

155
00:16:46,860 --> 00:16:48,850
I said get out.

156
00:16:49,170 --> 00:16:53,500
I took care of you after your mother left.

157
00:16:53,760 --> 00:16:56,900
Are you going to regret losing your father for a girl like that for the rest of your life?

158
00:16:57,160 --> 00:17:00,480
For a woman like you, my father

159
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:04,910
abandoned my mother.

160
00:17:05,370 --> 00:17:12,910
Stop pretending that you don't know anything.

161
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:20,150
I came here because your mother wanted me to.

162
00:17:22,180 --> 00:17:26,270
I'm just a unfamous singer, your father do like me,

163
00:17:26,620 --> 00:17:28,540
but that's it.

164
00:17:28,890 --> 00:17:32,920
As you know, you mother wasn't happy here.

165
00:17:34,260 --> 00:17:37,000
She didn't like living as the lady of the K Corporation.

166
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:43,320
She asked me to take care of you and your father.

167
00:17:43,610 --> 00:17:46,310
- What are you talkign about? - Yes.

168
00:17:48,030 --> 00:17:54,220
Don't believe, don't believe that kind of silly love exists.

169
00:17:59,990 --> 00:18:02,620
Tell your father yourself.

170
00:18:04,420 --> 00:18:07,930
He won't listen to me anymore.

171
00:18:30,970 --> 00:18:33,440
Mr. Jo wanted me to give you a ride.

172
00:18:34,040 --> 00:18:35,720
Thank you.

173
00:18:39,930 --> 00:18:42,600
He's busy today.

174
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:45,570
Really?

175
00:18:45,890 --> 00:18:47,950
Let's go.

176
00:18:54,050 --> 00:18:55,960
I did have Mr. Kang Woo Chul in my car that day.

177
00:18:56,420 --> 00:18:59,080
But when I stopped for a minute, he disappeared.

178
00:18:59,380 --> 00:19:01,470
The bracelet he was wearing was gone.

179
00:19:01,860 --> 00:19:04,230
Not a lot of people know what that is.

180
00:19:04,910 --> 00:19:08,870
The person who gave my father the bracelet might have taken it off.

181
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:14,510
Leaving her sick father home alone, Ms. Kang was drinking at a club.

182
00:19:15,380 --> 00:19:17,370
She called me later and said that her father was missing.

183
00:19:17,710 --> 00:19:21,360
I went there to do her a favor.

184
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:25,830
The owner of the store saw my father that day,

185
00:19:26,150 --> 00:19:30,770
she said my fatehr looked normal and even recognized her on that day.

186
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:34,570
What did my father tell you

187
00:19:35,050 --> 00:19:39,660
that scared you enough to dump him in the street?

188
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:53,550
This is just the beginning.

189
00:19:54,530 --> 00:20:00,020
You'll have to tell me what happened to my father on that day.

190
00:20:00,290 --> 00:20:03,300
No matter how hard you try, you can't prove anything.

191
00:20:03,770 --> 00:20:04,650
You're wasting your time.

192
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:07,660
No matter how long it takes,

193
00:20:08,170 --> 00:20:10,530
I'll make you confess your sins from your own mouth.

194
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:13,840
Do you know what the common illusion that people like you have?

195
00:20:14,150 --> 00:20:16,390
Believing that truth and justice always win.

196
00:20:17,460 --> 00:20:21,450
Don't be silly. That doesn't happen.

197
00:20:21,940 --> 00:20:24,070
Don't you get it?

198
00:20:24,400 --> 00:20:28,110
Only those who have power can protect their loved ones and get justice.

199
00:20:28,960 --> 00:20:31,180
That's why we ended up like this.

200
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:33,850
How do you become a man like this?

201
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:50,520
I thought I was the one who liked publicity. I can't compare with you.

202
00:20:53,550 --> 00:20:56,550
Do you decide to be a just man?

203
00:20:58,420 --> 00:21:01,750
Or are you just a whistle blower who betrayed his own company?

204
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:02,980
What are you talking about?

205
00:21:03,320 --> 00:21:06,900
People are talking and it's all over the news.

206
00:21:07,840 --> 00:21:12,370
I told you that Min Hyuk isn't a pushover.

207
00:21:12,700 --> 00:21:14,940
Who you could easily take on.

208
00:21:15,290 --> 00:21:17,920
I didn't do anything. Jo Min Hyuk broke the law.

209
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:21,360
If he broke the law, he'll be punished,

210
00:21:21,670 --> 00:21:25,320
but that's not my case.

211
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:32,930
That girl was the hit-and-run driver, right?

212
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:40,800
When this is over, I'll volunteer for your investigation.

213
00:21:44,850 --> 00:21:47,730
It's alleged that Ahn Do Hoon,

214
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:50,710
who revealed the K Corporation's illegal activities, actually embezzled 6.5 billion KRW from a branch

215
00:21:50,880 --> 00:21:54,270
that the K Corporation founded in Hong Kong.

216
00:21:54,460 --> 00:21:57,830
Mr. Jo Min Hyuk, the heir of the K Corporation

217
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,610
said during the press conference today that...

218
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:04,370
Have you been here before?

219
00:22:06,050 --> 00:22:07,960
It's pretty high.

220
00:22:08,670 --> 00:22:11,980
It's a good height to fall from.

221
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:18,240
6.5 billion.

222
00:22:19,040 --> 00:22:23,050
I didn't take the money. It went into constructing your building.

223
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:25,410
You're right.

224
00:22:26,790 --> 00:22:28,680
But there's no evidence of that.

225
00:22:28,850 --> 00:22:30,310
Gwang Min is careful.

226
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:32,520
He didn't leave any evidence.

227
00:22:33,340 --> 00:22:37,200
Just like you.

228
00:22:38,460 --> 00:22:40,220
Congratulations on your marriage.

229
00:22:40,510 --> 00:22:43,870
Congressman Shin slapped Se Yeon yesterday.

230
00:22:44,120 --> 00:22:48,910
You're the one who made her life miserable.

231
00:22:49,340 --> 00:22:54,810
I have nothing more to lose. Yoo Jung said,

232
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:59,360
the more you own, the more you worried.

233
00:22:59,810 --> 00:23:04,350
You have a lot more to lose than me.

234
00:23:05,060 --> 00:23:09,020
I wanted to take it away from you, but it's tired.

235
00:23:09,620 --> 00:23:11,740
That's why I'm taking you down with me.

236
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:14,320
I have no intention of going down with you.

237
00:23:14,500 --> 00:23:16,610
Let's say that I embezzled 6.5 billion KRW.

238
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:21,470
Let's destroy the K Corporation and the Shina Foundation together with me.

239
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,630
Your father will spend some time in jail.

240
00:23:23,790 --> 00:23:26,380
You, Se Yeon and Congressman Shin

241
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:31,030
will have to be investigated.

242
00:23:31,190 --> 00:23:35,650
You alone can't destroy our company that easily.

243
00:23:35,810 --> 00:23:37,350
I'm not alone.

244
00:23:37,540 --> 00:23:42,480
People who are sick of rich guys will join me.

245
00:23:42,650 --> 00:23:45,330
Do you think it'll make a difference?

246
00:23:46,970 --> 00:23:49,490
I thought you were smart,

247
00:23:50,330 --> 00:23:53,260
but you're an idealist.

248
00:23:58,730 --> 00:24:01,270
On the night of the accident...

249
00:24:03,540 --> 00:24:09,510
I was driving, not Yoo Jung.

250
00:24:10,860 --> 00:24:17,650
Do you want me to repeat it so you can record it?

251
00:24:20,710 --> 00:24:26,550
Yoo Jung didn't kill her. I did.

252
00:24:28,870 --> 00:24:31,990
Yoo Jung volunteered to go to jail for me.

253
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:35,420
I tried to stop her, but she wouldn't listen.

254
00:24:35,660 --> 00:24:36,920
Ahn Do Hoon.

255
00:24:37,080 --> 00:24:39,360
She's that kind of a girl.

256
00:24:39,660 --> 00:24:43,750
She gave up her own life because of love.

257
00:24:44,460 --> 00:24:48,010
The files and the recording.

258
00:24:50,400 --> 00:24:52,720
Do whatever you want with them.

259
00:24:53,870 --> 00:24:55,970
But I'm curious.

260
00:24:57,210 --> 00:25:00,740
Do you think you can protect the woman,

261
00:25:01,540 --> 00:25:03,290
that I was unable to protect?

262
00:25:03,490 --> 00:25:04,780
Stay away from Yoo Jung.

263
00:25:04,940 --> 00:25:07,230
I will.

264
00:25:08,110 --> 00:25:14,070
If I destroy you, she'll ruin herself.

265
00:25:20,850 --> 00:25:23,340
You poor bastard!

266
00:25:24,770 --> 00:25:29,160
You don't know what you've lost, yet.

267
00:25:37,500 --> 00:25:41,290
I hope the person Yoo Jung once loved

268
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:47,830
wasn't this same bastard I see right now.

269
00:26:13,550 --> 00:26:18,670
Father, you're still not well enough.

270
00:26:18,830 --> 00:26:19,900
You can't do this, father.

271
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:22,350
Do you expect me to lie here

272
00:26:22,550 --> 00:26:26,550
and watch you destroy my company? You bastard.

273
00:26:31,820 --> 00:26:33,300
Father!

274
00:26:42,090 --> 00:26:47,800
I've been working for 60 years with this body.

275
00:26:48,230 --> 00:26:51,860
It's no wonder why my body can't bear anymore.

276
00:26:54,720 --> 00:27:00,640
I've made enough money,

277
00:27:01,140 --> 00:27:06,080
but I've always bowed down to authority.

278
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:10,230
I only wanted one thing from you.

279
00:27:10,510 --> 00:27:15,420
To stand up to authority.

280
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:20,450
That's why you need Congressman Shin.

281
00:27:20,930 --> 00:27:24,610
You know that I'm not that excellent.

282
00:27:26,290 --> 00:27:28,260
What I want to protect

283
00:27:31,460 --> 00:27:33,630
is that girl.

284
00:27:34,470 --> 00:27:39,830
Love is good.

285
00:27:40,380 --> 00:27:45,390
But time will change everything.

286
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:49,040
You'll forget her over time.

287
00:27:54,230 --> 00:27:56,900
Your mother,

288
00:27:58,620 --> 00:28:03,900
she is the daughter of a gambler who owned a small inn.

289
00:28:04,190 --> 00:28:08,180
Her father brought her to me to pay his debt.

290
00:28:08,390 --> 00:28:11,300
I built her a small hotel,

291
00:28:11,580 --> 00:28:16,370
and that's how the K Hotel started.

292
00:28:17,420 --> 00:28:23,470
During the opening ceremony, she smiled so brightly.

293
00:28:23,820 --> 00:28:32,390
That's the last time I saw your mother smile.

294
00:28:35,720 --> 00:28:36,650
Father.

295
00:28:36,810 --> 00:28:45,980
I can't stand to lose the K Hotel just because of you.

296
00:28:46,580 --> 00:28:50,340
I'm not greedy.

297
00:28:50,870 --> 00:28:57,580
I'm asking you as the boss of the K Hotel,

298
00:28:58,530 --> 00:29:05,750
to protect the K Hotel on my behalf.

299
00:29:06,150 --> 00:29:12,160
Don't make Gwang Min's sacrifice be in vain.

300
00:29:16,390 --> 00:29:19,470
Please.

301
00:29:31,630 --> 00:29:33,980
I said I'd see you again.

302
00:29:34,340 --> 00:29:37,990
Look! The house is empty.

303
00:29:39,080 --> 00:29:44,410
I sent my daughter abroad for a while.

304
00:29:45,710 --> 00:29:47,950
Have you seen the news?

305
00:29:48,920 --> 00:29:52,010
If Min Hyuk cancel the engagement with Se Yeon, the situation will become worse.

306
00:29:52,190 --> 00:29:54,310
Min Hyuk won't be safe, either.

307
00:29:54,500 --> 00:29:56,760
Investigations, trials, and jail.

308
00:29:57,000 --> 00:30:00,840
Do you want him to become a convict, just like you?

309
00:30:01,670 --> 00:30:05,150
Is that how you love Min Hyuk?

310
00:30:05,340 --> 00:30:06,260
Madam.

311
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:10,520
Min Hyuk's father is very sick.

312
00:30:10,730 --> 00:30:12,650
If Min Hyuk leave,

313
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:15,130
his father's condition might get worse.

314
00:30:17,230 --> 00:30:22,740
Min Hyuk doesn't have the luxury of pursuing his own happiness while abandoning his father.

315
00:30:23,080 --> 00:30:25,430
You know that, right?

316
00:30:28,690 --> 00:30:31,460
Do I have to say more?

317
00:30:38,560 --> 00:30:43,780
When Min Hyuk is happy, he'll scold others.

318
00:30:45,900 --> 00:30:49,170
When he's grateful he'll get snappy.

319
00:30:50,260 --> 00:30:52,490
But,

320
00:30:53,950 --> 00:30:57,160
He seldom shows his depression.

321
00:31:02,260 --> 00:31:06,490
I know he's depressed about his mother's death.

322
00:31:06,790 --> 00:31:12,290
You're his mother at the moment.

323
00:31:13,840 --> 00:31:20,530
Please take good care of him.

324
00:31:45,010 --> 00:31:49,960
It's me. Are you free tomorrow?

325
00:31:55,920 --> 00:32:00,530
Is this the place you want to go with me?

326
00:32:03,250 --> 00:32:09,520
I wasn't able to be at his deathbed.

327
00:32:14,470 --> 00:32:22,940
It hurts me when I think how lonely he must've been.

328
00:32:24,660 --> 00:32:27,920
I know how it feels

329
00:32:28,430 --> 00:32:30,910
to desert my own father

330
00:32:31,310 --> 00:32:34,400
because of the one I loved.

331
00:32:35,470 --> 00:32:41,410
I know how regertful it is.

332
00:32:41,620 --> 00:32:42,950
Yoo Jung.

333
00:32:44,280 --> 00:32:49,480
How can I ask you to abandon your own father to be with me?

334
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:53,710
Stop! Stop saying it.

335
00:33:18,300 --> 00:33:20,580
Look at you.

336
00:33:21,180 --> 00:33:23,910
You're already in great agony. But you never say it.

337
00:33:24,210 --> 00:33:25,570
Don't worry about me.

338
00:33:25,740 --> 00:33:31,020
I went to the restaurant. The workers are worried about our company.

339
00:33:32,060 --> 00:33:34,540
If you abandon them because of me,

340
00:33:34,780 --> 00:33:39,780
you're doing a terrible thing to the workers who've been working hard for you.

341
00:33:40,180 --> 00:33:42,740
I can't let that happen.

342
00:33:42,770 --> 00:33:47,290
I don't want to feel guilty to those people.

343
00:33:47,460 --> 00:33:50,060
I don't care about them.

344
00:33:50,270 --> 00:33:52,690
I'm not a great person.

345
00:33:52,890 --> 00:33:55,320
I just want to protect my girl.

346
00:33:55,590 --> 00:33:57,650
No! I can't!

347
00:33:57,900 --> 00:33:59,970
I told you that I only want you to be with me.

348
00:34:00,130 --> 00:34:03,310
Stop saying the nonsense.

349
00:34:05,300 --> 00:34:07,640
It sucks.

350
00:34:21,210 --> 00:34:26,010
I have a interview. Make it quick.

351
00:34:44,050 --> 00:34:46,210
Kwang Soo.

352
00:34:47,660 --> 00:34:52,530
Destroy the files and the tape.

353
00:35:12,140 --> 00:35:13,730
Yoo Jung.

354
00:35:14,730 --> 00:35:17,090
Play with me.

355
00:35:17,610 --> 00:35:19,800
You want me to skip off my work?

356
00:35:21,390 --> 00:35:23,750
Just today.

357
00:35:24,350 --> 00:35:30,410
Just today...

358
00:35:32,280 --> 00:35:35,300
I'll play with you just today.

359
00:36:22,150 --> 00:36:24,580
What wish did you make?

360
00:36:25,580 --> 00:36:27,610
It's a secret.

361
00:36:29,970 --> 00:36:31,730
Thank you.

362
00:36:31,730 --> 00:36:32,990
Have a good day.

363
00:36:42,040 --> 00:36:44,490
Fresh octopus.

364
00:36:44,490 --> 00:36:49,350
It's fresh, buy some.

365
00:36:49,350 --> 00:36:51,490
I'll give you a discount.

366
00:37:10,590 --> 00:37:12,090
Fried Rice Cake again?

367
00:37:12,090 --> 00:37:14,250
You know I don't like spicy food.

368
00:37:19,370 --> 00:37:21,100
Just try it.

369
00:37:34,930 --> 00:37:36,850
It's not spicy.

370
00:37:37,930 --> 00:37:40,110
It's delicious.

371
00:37:46,680 --> 00:37:49,720
I think I hired a good employee.

372
00:37:54,450 --> 00:37:57,880
After we arranged everything,

373
00:37:57,920 --> 00:38:00,350
can we live somewhere like this?

374
00:38:04,880 --> 00:38:06,890
Shall we?

375
00:38:31,610 --> 00:38:34,460
Don't make such an expression.

376
00:38:35,720 --> 00:38:37,700
Smile.

377
00:38:37,700 --> 00:38:40,850
Let's make today a happy memory.

378
00:39:06,870 --> 00:39:09,190
Sir.

379
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:11,850
Aren't we going back?

380
00:39:13,750 --> 00:39:16,690
I guess we should.

381
00:39:19,200 --> 00:39:24,970
We've come too far.

382
00:39:25,040 --> 00:39:27,710
It's hard to get back today.

383
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:37,520
I wish today would never end.

384
00:39:40,580 --> 00:39:43,540
That may be boring.

385
00:39:45,940 --> 00:39:47,770
So,

386
00:39:49,520 --> 00:39:52,890
let's keep the memory till tomorrow.

387
00:39:57,090 --> 00:39:59,550
Till tomorrow.

388
00:42:21,250 --> 00:42:27,670
Can people live without love?

389
00:42:55,960 --> 00:42:59,610
He was sipping his peppermint tea

390
00:42:59,610 --> 00:43:04,030
instead of answering the question.

391
00:43:09,110 --> 00:43:11,050
Why?

392
00:43:19,730 --> 00:43:21,740
I'll stop here.

393
00:43:21,740 --> 00:43:24,330
What did he say?

394
00:43:24,330 --> 00:43:26,380
Is that all?

395
00:43:26,380 --> 00:43:28,720
If you want to know,

396
00:43:28,720 --> 00:43:31,620
read it

397
00:43:31,820 --> 00:43:33,480
after I leave.

398
00:43:33,480 --> 00:43:35,470
No.

399
00:43:36,120 --> 00:43:38,720
I want you to read it for me.

400
00:43:42,140 --> 00:43:47,160
I can't see your face while reading.

401
00:43:51,830 --> 00:43:56,250
Just like this.

402
00:43:56,610 --> 00:44:00,170
Can we stay like this for a while?

403
00:45:19,930 --> 00:45:25,800
I think what my grandpa said before his 70s

404
00:45:25,800 --> 00:45:28,320
is right,

405
00:45:34,320 --> 00:45:40,250
People can't live

406
00:45:41,080 --> 00:45:43,520
without love.

407
00:46:10,870 --> 00:46:13,810
You asked me to love you.

408
00:46:15,060 --> 00:46:17,430
How?

409
00:46:22,360 --> 00:46:24,410
Yoo Jung!

410
00:46:28,510 --> 00:46:31,380
How can this be love?

411
00:46:34,830 --> 00:46:37,270
It hurts so much.

412
00:46:37,720 --> 00:46:41,210
I can't stand it.

413
00:46:41,480 --> 00:46:44,520
Is that love?

414
00:46:45,330 --> 00:46:49,290
It's love.

415
00:46:50,140 --> 00:46:53,100
When you miss someong,

416
00:46:53,100 --> 00:47:00,690
the pain and loneliness are also love.

417
00:47:11,500 --> 00:47:16,790
I think,

418
00:47:17,490 --> 00:47:27,640
you seem to be suffered a lot.

419
00:48:17,760 --> 00:48:20,320
You haven't eaten, right?

420
00:48:28,370 --> 00:48:30,140
Ja Yeong.

421
00:48:31,860 --> 00:48:38,250
I did the right thing,

422
00:48:40,570 --> 00:48:42,570
right?

423
00:48:43,050 --> 00:48:50,480
How can I be with him?

424
00:48:53,340 --> 00:48:59,760
I can't do that, right?

425
00:49:02,080 --> 00:49:09,120
So...

426
00:49:10,180 --> 00:49:16,840
I did the right thing letting him go,

427
00:49:17,980 --> 00:49:19,940
right?

428
00:49:19,940 --> 00:49:22,020
Yes.

429
00:49:22,240 --> 00:49:25,860
You did the right thing.

430
00:49:30,290 --> 00:49:32,700
Are you sure?

431
00:49:35,430 --> 00:49:38,990
Why can't I hold back my tears?

432
00:49:52,080 --> 00:49:55,630
If you don't cry after letting someone go,

433
00:49:55,630 --> 00:49:57,960
that'd be even stranger.

434
00:51:03,080 --> 00:51:05,370
Tear this dress up

435
00:51:05,420 --> 00:51:07,610
for me.

436
00:51:37,140 --> 00:51:39,860
Did you know that your son embezzled 6.5 billion KRW?

437
00:51:39,860 --> 00:51:43,910
We don't know anything. My son is a good man.

438
00:51:43,910 --> 00:51:46,180
Madam, where is your son now?

439
00:51:46,180 --> 00:51:47,590
Go away! Go!

440
00:51:47,590 --> 00:51:48,540
Just one more thing to ask.

441
00:51:48,540 --> 00:51:49,620
Go away. Come on.

442
00:51:49,620 --> 00:51:51,300
Please answer it.

443
00:51:51,610 --> 00:51:53,310
Just answer it.

444
00:51:53,680 --> 00:51:55,570
Damn it.

445
00:51:57,340 --> 00:52:00,140
What's going on?

446
00:52:22,290 --> 00:52:26,960
You made Min Hyuk break up with her.

447
00:52:28,790 --> 00:52:30,230
Thank you.

448
00:52:30,230 --> 00:52:35,140
Are you happy now?

449
00:52:35,140 --> 00:52:37,550
I told you

450
00:52:37,600 --> 00:52:41,300
I had to have him at least once.

451
00:53:05,190 --> 00:53:07,190
Yoo Jung.

452
00:53:08,890 --> 00:53:12,640
Thanks to you, business is going well.

453
00:53:12,680 --> 00:53:14,070
What a pity.

454
00:53:14,070 --> 00:53:17,380
Thank you.

455
00:53:54,040 --> 00:53:57,520
Yoo Jung, let's talk outside.

456
00:53:57,960 --> 00:54:00,720
Why should I go outside?

457
00:54:02,720 --> 00:54:04,810
Do Hoon will be here soon.

458
00:54:04,810 --> 00:54:06,090
Get out!

459
00:54:06,240 --> 00:54:08,350
We have customers here.

460
00:54:08,350 --> 00:54:09,270
Why?

461
00:54:09,270 --> 00:54:11,300
You're worried about your lawyer son?

462
00:54:11,300 --> 00:54:13,880
How dare you?

463
00:54:14,250 --> 00:54:16,300
Why don't you think about my dad?

464
00:54:16,300 --> 00:54:18,880
Your son abandoned my father in the street,

465
00:54:18,880 --> 00:54:21,990
and let him die after wandering away in his bare feet.

466
00:54:21,990 --> 00:54:24,350
Don't make things up.

467
00:54:24,350 --> 00:54:25,820
Take her out.

468
00:54:25,820 --> 00:54:27,270
She's botHae Ring the customers.

469
00:54:27,270 --> 00:54:31,300
I'm telling you the truth, how can you pretend nothing happened?

470
00:54:31,590 --> 00:54:34,700
Bring back my father!

471
00:54:34,860 --> 00:54:38,110
Yoo Jung, let's talk outside.

472
00:54:38,110 --> 00:54:40,370
You don't believe it?

473
00:54:40,370 --> 00:54:42,320
That's reasonable.

474
00:54:42,320 --> 00:54:45,280
I couldn't believe it at first.

475
00:54:45,920 --> 00:54:47,790
Mother...

476
00:54:47,850 --> 00:54:53,760
You hated when I called you ‘mother.'

477
00:54:53,800 --> 00:54:55,950
Madam

478
00:54:57,460 --> 00:55:00,900
I'm here to ask your son what happened.

479
00:55:02,100 --> 00:55:03,940
Get out!

480
00:55:08,250 --> 00:55:10,060
Don't you book another room?

481
00:55:10,060 --> 00:55:11,260
Cancel the honeymoon.

482
00:55:11,260 --> 00:55:13,560
I don't want to go.

483
00:55:13,850 --> 00:55:15,550
Se Yeon.

484
00:55:16,840 --> 00:55:19,070
Are you enjoying this?

485
00:55:20,080 --> 00:55:21,890
I'm not.

486
00:55:21,940 --> 00:55:24,130
I didn't do this for fun.

487
00:55:25,650 --> 00:55:29,180
I need to change. Can you excuse me?

488
00:55:29,300 --> 00:55:32,540
Okay. Get some rest.

489
00:55:44,740 --> 00:55:46,930
Married couples can divorce,

490
00:55:46,970 --> 00:55:49,180
but you two only dated for a few years.

491
00:55:49,210 --> 00:55:52,100
How dare you try to ruin my son's life?

492
00:55:53,080 --> 00:55:55,500
You killed someone. Remember?

493
00:55:55,530 --> 00:55:58,380
Stop. That's all gone.

494
00:55:58,410 --> 00:56:00,880
Someone died. How can we forget?

495
00:56:03,930 --> 00:56:05,750
Right.

496
00:56:05,860 --> 00:56:11,010
You can't just forget about someone who you killed.

497
00:56:11,050 --> 00:56:12,860
Since you know that, why are you here?

498
00:56:12,860 --> 00:56:14,940
Do you still believe it was me?

499
00:56:14,980 --> 00:56:15,630
What?

500
00:56:15,630 --> 00:56:17,610
Don't pretend that you didn't know.

501
00:56:17,750 --> 00:56:20,440
I just bought the car,

502
00:56:20,440 --> 00:56:22,130
but Do Hoon drove it all the time.

503
00:56:23,620 --> 00:56:26,050
You remember the day after the accident.

504
00:56:26,090 --> 00:56:28,140
When I get the key from you.

505
00:56:28,810 --> 00:56:30,060
What are you talking about?

506
00:56:30,060 --> 00:56:32,270
Don't you understand?

507
00:56:32,460 --> 00:56:34,890
Should I tell those people outside?

508
00:56:38,760 --> 00:56:42,310
You! I've been patient enough. How dare you?

509
00:56:42,340 --> 00:56:45,270
That's enough. I've had enough of it.

510
00:56:45,390 --> 00:56:47,670
You have had enough of it?

511
00:56:48,690 --> 00:56:53,350
What about your son who hit someone

512
00:56:53,350 --> 00:56:56,050
and let her die and left my father to die?

513
00:56:56,050 --> 00:56:58,840
How long should he be locked up for?

514
00:56:58,880 --> 00:57:01,270
Longer than me, I guess.

515
00:57:01,390 --> 00:57:02,360
Are you crazy?

516
00:57:02,400 --> 00:57:03,920
No.

517
00:57:04,960 --> 00:57:11,600
I'm saner than I've ever been.

518
00:57:12,750 --> 00:57:14,120
What are you afraid of?

519
00:57:14,150 --> 00:57:16,400
Go tell those reporters.

520
00:57:16,440 --> 00:57:17,950
Stop!

521
00:57:17,990 --> 00:57:19,910
Why should I stop?

522
00:57:20,880 --> 00:57:26,460
Attention! I have something to say about the great lawyer Ahn Do Hoon.

523
00:57:26,500 --> 00:57:28,180
- Mr. Ahn.- Mr. Ahn.

524
00:57:28,220 --> 00:57:29,510
- Please answer the question. - Mr. Ahn.

525
00:57:29,540 --> 00:57:31,880
Get out.

526
00:57:31,910 --> 00:57:36,250
I said stop. Stop.

527
00:57:37,330 --> 00:57:39,990
That's enough.

528
00:57:40,020 --> 00:57:41,270
What?

529
00:57:45,680 --> 00:57:47,580
San...

530
00:57:54,620 --> 00:57:59,160
Don't you want to see him?

531
00:58:02,980 --> 00:58:05,240
San...

532
00:58:05,240 --> 00:58:07,330
Your son.

533
00:58:07,330 --> 00:58:10,030
Don't you miss him?
